WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.750
Before the gates open, check your area: E-X-I-T-S.

2
00:00:05.950 --> 00:00:08.200
Exits clear and unlocked.

3
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.850
Extinguishers in place.

4
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:11.700
No ignition sources.

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:13.150
Trash cleared.

6
00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:16.400
Signs lit and fire doors closed.

7
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Quick and safe to fix? Fix it and tell your supervisor.

8
00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:29.700
If not, report it - and it stays open until someone confirms it's fixed.

9
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.400
A locked exit - report it and stay with it, from a safe position.

